Here is information on how to access one computer medium via another.
Please send any corrections/updates/additions to kadie@eff.org.

How to:

=======================
* access anonymous ftp via email
=======================

There are a variety of ftp mail servers
(ftpmail@decwrl.dec.com is a popular choice).  If you send it a
message with the text:

help

you'll get a manual, but normally you'd send it a message such as:

connect some.host.somewhere.else
get somefilename
quit

