=======================
* read netnews via 'rn' from another site
=======================
For a list of sites, do:
  finger lesikar@tigger.stcloud.msus.edu

WARNING, WARNING, WARNING
For each site you will want a different version of your ".newsrc" file.
1. Copy your current .newsrc file somewhere safe
For example, "mv .newsrc .newsrc.local"
2. Set your "NNTP" variable to one of these sites:
   m.cs.du.edu
For example, type "setenv NNTP m.cs.du.edu"
3. Run 'rn"
For example, "rn"
4. Before you sign off, restore your old ".newsrc"
For example, "cp .newsrc .newsrc.other; cp .newsrc.local .newsrc"


